        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "From 1.5n>=21 incorrectly reverse the order to n<=14; take the remaining positive indices as negative.", "misconception": "Reverse the inequality when dividing by the positive 1.5."}
      ]}
