      "intent": {"task": "Find the least index with a strictly negative term and evaluate that term.", "source_solution": "d=-0.18; a_n=5.48-0.18n<0 iff n>274/9. Thus a_31=-0.10, with a_30=0.08 confirming firstness.", "unit_reason": "The least index and its value are linked and retained together; the separate positive-crossing progression is independent.", "concept_blocks": [5], "limitations": ["Recognition cannot establish independently solving and rounding the strict index inequality."], "figure_observations": []},
