    {
      "id": "q250-reciprocal-exponents", "source_numbers": ["250"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "在原式有意义的范围内，$a,b,c$ 均非零。化简 $\\displaystyle\\frac{9a^5b^{-1}}{c^2}\\div\\frac{6a^4c^{-2}}{b^2}$，结果是哪一项？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{3a}{2b^3}$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{2}{3ab}$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{3ab}{2c^4}$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "D", "text": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{3ab}{2}$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify the entire quotient with negative exponents while maintaining the original domain.", "source_solution": "Multiply by b^2/(6a^4c^(-2)): coefficient 9/6, exponents a:5-4=1,b:-1+2=1,c:-2-(-2)=0. Result 3ab/2 for nonzero a,b,c.", "unit_reason": "Reciprocal placement and all exponent cancellations form one complete expression task.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Selection cannot demonstrate independently writing the reciprocal transformation and domain reasoning."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["D"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "After reversing the divisor, wrongly divide by b^2 instead of multiplying: b^(-1-2)=b^(-3); the other factors give 3a/2.", "misconception": "Fail to move the divisor's denominator b^2 into the numerator of its reciprocal."},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Take the reciprocal of the whole correct quotient 3ab/2, giving 2/(3ab).", "misconception": "Reverse the order of the two original fractions in the division."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Use 1/c^(-2)=c^(-2) instead of c^2 when inverting the divisor; c exponents sum to -4 while a,b give ab.", "misconception": "Leave the sign of the c exponent unchanged when reciprocating its factor."},
        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "(9/6)a^(5-4)b^(-1+2)c^(-2+2)=3ab/2; original nonzero restrictions persist.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q251-base-five", "source_numbers": ["251"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "计算 $\\displaystyle\\frac{0.04^{-2}\\cdot125^4\\cdot0.2^{-1}}{4\\cdot25^8}$ 的值。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
