      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "计算 $\\displaystyle\\frac{3^{-10}\\cdot7^{-5}\\left(\\frac19\\right)^{-2}}{\\left(\\frac1{21}\\right)^8\\cdot49}$ 的值。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
