        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Replace 49=7^2 by its base 7, so the denominator's 7 exponent becomes -7 and the quotient becomes 3^2*7^2=441.", "misconception": "Keep the prime base of 49 but omit its square exponent."}
      ]}
    },
